Dev instance now installs NTC nautobot-secrets-providers[one-password] 4.x (from git develop, the only line supporting Nautobot 3.x) so the real PSK read path — get_value() through the one-password provider, used by both the build job and tunnel-status — is exercised locally instead of only the OP_DEV_BYPASS text-file provider. get_secret_provider_params now emits the {vault, item, field} shape the provider reads.
